<div><strong>Time</strong></div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Hours / o'clock</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms small">-시</div>
        <div class="col">number + shi</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>Minutes</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms small">-분</div>
        <div class="col">number + pun</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>Seconds</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms small">-초</div>
        <div class="col">number + ch'o</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>How many minutes?</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms small">몇 분</div>
        <div class="col">myŏt pun</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>What time is it?</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms small">몇 시에요?</div>
    <div>myŏt shi-eyo?</div>
    <div><strong>12 o'clock</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms small">열두시</div>
        <div class="col">yŏl-du-shi</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>3 minutes</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms small">삼분</div>
        <div class="col">sam-pun</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>20 seconds</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms small">이십초</div>
        <div class="col">i-ship-ch'o</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>3:35</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms small">세시 삼십오분</div>
    <div>se-shi sam-shib-o-bun</div>
    <div><strong>at 2:40</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms small">두시 사십분에</div>
    <div>tu-shi sa-ship-pun-e</div>
    <div><strong>it is 2:40</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms small">두시 사십분이에요</div>
    <div>tu-shi sa-ship-pun-ieyo</div>
    <div><strong>1:30</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms small">한시 반</div>
    <div>han-shi pan</div>
    <div><strong>4:35 p.m. on Tuesday</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms small">오후 4시 35분 화요일에</div>
    <div>ohu ne-shi sam-ship-o-bun hwayoil-e</div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms small">화요일 오후 4시 35분</div>
    <div>hwayoil ohu ne-shi sam-ship-o-bun</div>
</div>
